ve:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3c7057db-dc56-4134-89c0-3b47e5a23205_4032x3024.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E-4H!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3c7057db-dc56-4134-89c0-3b47e5a23205_4032x3024.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!E-4H!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3c7057db-dc56-4134-89c0-3b47e5a23205_4032x3024.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Owen Muir, M.D.,  DFAACAP Next to Carlene MacMillan, M.D., who creates a series of helpful guides as the chair of the AACAP committee responsible for the “Facts for Families Series.”</figcaption></figure></div><p>For those hoping for actual <em>solutions</em>?  The <a href=\"https://www.aacap.org/AACAP/Families_and_Youth/Facts_for_Families/Layout/FFF_Guide-01.aspx\">AACAP Facts for Families </a>series of guides exist!  For example, you can <a href=\"https://www.aacap.org/AACAP/AACAP/Families_and_Youth/Facts_for_Families/FFF-Guide/Preparing_Childs_First_Cell_Phone-140.aspx\">learn how to prepare for your child’s first cell phone.</a>  You can also get expert guidance from actual child psychiatry doctors on<a href=\"https://www.aacap.org/AACAP/AACAP/Families_and_Youth/Facts_for_Families/FFF-Guide/Children-Online-059.aspx\"> Internet Use In Children.</a>  Or we could follow scaremongering from the Surgeon General?  That is also an option.</p><p>My ChatGPT prompt:</p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p> “Please generate a scary warning label for social media that the surgeon general could place on social media platforms that would terrify young people into not using social media quite as much.”</p></div><p>Here is the warning label it came up with:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic\" width=\"534\" height=\"534\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1024,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:534,&quot;bytes&quot;:220273,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hjri!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8883c13c-a37d-47b5-98d3-bf77f260ccd3_1024x1024.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I think we are <em>really getting somewhere.</em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"Yesterday’s column was a fine article, but what if you miss my snarky tone while reading it to yourself? Problem? Solved. Dear Readers, here is the podcast version of the aforementioned article!\n\nShare\n\nOwen Muir, M.D., DFAACAP Next to Carlene MacMillan, M.D., who creates a series of helpful guides as the chair of the AACAP committee responsible for the “Facts for Families Series.”\n\nFor those hoping for actual solutions ? The AACAP Facts for Families series of guides exist! For example, you can learn how to prepare for your child’s first cell phone. You can also get expert guidance from actual child psychiatry doctors on Internet Use In Children. Or we could follow scaremongering from the Surgeon General? That is also an option.\n\nMy ChatGPT prompt:\n\n“Please generate a scary warning label for social media that the surgeon general could place on social media platforms that would terrify young people into not using social media quite as much.”\n\nHere is the warning label it came up with:\n\nI think we are really getting somewhere.\n\nSubscribe now"}